# Opus 4.8 (Sec. 3.2) as the underlying LLM.

###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The MAE of 1.21 eV is computed by the Detective Agent and quoted in the action log (Table 1); the errors are described as bimodal (5 of 36 systems with large errors). Committee-model errors on the benchmark are not stated.
# - PFP is the TeaNet architecture (registry method); SevenNet is a NequIP implementation. Checkpoints other than PFP v9.0.0/v8.0.0 are not identified, so all models are paper-local runs.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/okuno2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

